content.com/u/439362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer","html_url":"https://github.com/normanmaurer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":35,"state":"closed","created_at":"2014-06-12T13:44:57Z","updated_at":"2014-07-03T19:33:10Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2014-07-01T16:17:24Z"},"comments":11,"created_at":"2013-12-22T17:06:17Z","updated_at":"2017-08-18T11:29:46Z","closed_at":"2014-06-02T10:26:59Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"We've noticed an issue where a global event executor thread lingers after calling `shutdownGracefully` on an event loop group. In practice, it goes away on its own after several hundred milliseconds, but it triggers alarms in cases where there's something looking for leaked resources (like a servlet container). Here's a sample app I wrote to illustrate the issue:\n\n``` java\nimport io.netty.channel.nio.NioEventLoopGroup;\n\npublic class NettyShutdownTestApp {\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws InterruptedException {\n        new NioEventLoopGroup().shutdownGracefully().sync();\n\n        // Expected: since we have shut down gracefully, there should be no\n        // running Netty threads at this point.\n        printRunningThreadList();\n    }\n\n    public static void printRunningThreadList() {\n        final Thread[] threads = new Thread[128];\n        getRootThreadGroup(Thread.currentThread().getThreadGroup()).enumerate(threads, true);\n\n        for (final Thread thread : threads) {\n            if (thread != null) {\n                System.out.println(thread.getName());\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static ThreadGroup getRootThreadGroup(ThreadGroup startingPoint) {\n        return startingPoint.getParent() == null ?\n                startingPoint : getRootThreadGroup(startingPoint.getParent());\n    }\n}\n```\n\nMy expectation would be that because we've gracefully shut down all Netty resources we created in our own app, all Netty-related threads would have stopped by the time the shutdown `Future` completed. When we dump the list of running threads after the sync, though, the actual list looks something like this:\n\n```\nReference Handler\nFinalizer\nSignal Dispatcher\nprocess reaper\nmain\nglobalEventExecutor-1-1\n```\n\nAs a control, if we never create the `NioEventLoopGroup` or never call `shutdownGracefully`, then `globalEventExecutor-1-1` doesn't appear in the list of running threads.\n\nThanks!\n","closed_by":{"login":"trustin","id":173918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzkxOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/trustin","html_url":"https://github.com/trustin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trustin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trustin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trustin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trustin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trustin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trustin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trustin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trustin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trustin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/2084/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/2084/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}